{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“让喜欢自然流露”是在描述他的心理状态与相处态度，没有把调情、回应等珠子里的可能性写成具体行动，也没有新增场景或对白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"这句话概括了他对眼前亲近的珍惜与不确定感，没有把珠子里的提前怀念写成真实发生的回忆或动作。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"他想让对方知道心意却害怕说开后关系变样，这能解释他为何让喜欢在相处中自然流露，而不急于直接说开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"暂时不必面对说开后的结果，让他可以专注于眼前的相处，也为喜欢自然流露提供了条件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"他不确定眼前的亲近还能持续多久，因此无法把这份亲近视为必然会一直拥有的东西。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能读出他从想表露心意却怕关系变样，转向让喜欢自然流露，继而意识到眼前的亲近并非必然能够长久。\"\n  ,\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"S08-1承接了S07已经确立的表露欲望与对后果的顾虑，推进到自然流露；S08-2虽回扣S04-3的不确定感，但它不是本段唯一的心理推动。\"\n  ,\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "650de610-4c84-49b8-a39e-ba2fcffdc470", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T071834517332Z", "elapsed_seconds": 271.156, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T07:23:05.674067+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d881f35d72d23e6af3b2c13de87f2c08d9db67aa2439e2dfd448cb0f73455755", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "in